* tb_por_brownout_spurious -- GENERATED by sim/build_tb.py
* Do not edit. Sources:
*   sim/por-brownout-spurious/testbench/stimulus.spice
*   design/netlist/temp_por_top.spice  (sha256 1cb191d10e6ae487649d7c8bb8746ba06c1049f5c8970cb6de7d2a60bf779bcc)
